    <!-- 7 GUSTAR THE FLIP -->
    <section class="screen">
      <span class="tag lo">gustar-type verbs · the flip</span>
      <h2>gustar — "to be pleasing to"</h2>
      <p>This is the trickiest structure at GCSE. <span class="es">gustar</span> does <b>not</b> mean "to like" directly — it means <b>"to be pleasing to"</b>. The sentence flips: <b>Object – Verb – Subject</b>.</p>
      <div class="eqn"><span class="es">me gusta el fútbol</span><small>literally: "football is pleasing to me" = I like football</small></div>
      <p>Choose <span class="hl v">gusta</span> before a <b>singular</b> noun or an <b>infinitive</b>; choose <span class="hl v">gustan</span> before a <b>plural</b> noun. The pronoun tells you <b>who</b> likes it:</p>
      <table class="conj" aria-label="Indirect object pronouns for gustar">
        <tr><th>pronoun</th><th>who likes it</th></tr>
        <tr><td>me</td><td>I like…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>te</td><td>you like…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>le</td><td>he / she likes…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>nos</td><td>we like…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>os</td><td>you all like…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>les</td><td>they like…</td></tr>
      </table>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="hl v">Me gusta</span> el fútbol. — I like football. <span style="color:var(--soft)">(singular)</span></li>
        <li><span class="hl v">Me gustan</span> los deportes. — I like sports. <span style="color:var(--soft)">(plural)</span></li>
        <li><span class="hl v">Me gusta</span> jugar. — I like to play. <span style="color:var(--soft)">(infinitive → gusta)</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note"><b>Clarify or emphasise</b> with <span class="es">A mí me gusta…</span>, <span class="es">A él le gusta…</span> Same-pattern verbs: <span class="es">encantar</span> (to love — <span class="es">Me encanta</span>), <span class="es">interesar</span> (<span class="es">Me interesa</span>), <span class="es">molestar</span> (to annoy), <span class="es">doler</span> (to hurt — <span class="es">Me duele la cabeza</span>, <span class="es">Me duelen los pies</span>).</p>
    </section>

