    <!-- 16 OPINION PHRASES -->
    <section class="screen">
      <span class="tag lo">Giving opinions</span>
      <h2>Saying what you think</h2>
      <p>To lift your speaking and writing marks, open with an <b>opinion phrase</b>, then a normal present-tense clause:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="es">creo que…</span> — I believe that…</li>
